IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPXID.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SEQ PIC 9(12).
01 WS-SEQ-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-SEQ-NAME PIC X(20).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-NUM PIC 9(11).
01 WS-ED11 PIC 9(11).
01 WS-ED10 PIC 9(10).
01 WS-PREFIX PIC X(01).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-ID-TYPE PIC X(08).
01 LS-ISPB PIC X(08).
01 LS-VALUE PIC X(32).
01 LS-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-ID-TYPE LS-ISPB LS-VALUE LS-RC.
    MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO LS-VALUE
    EVALUATE LS-ID-TYPE
        WHEN "PIX" PERFORM DOMAIN-ID
        WHEN "KEY" PERFORM KEY-ID
        WHEN "QRID" PERFORM QR-ID
        WHEN "DEVO" PERFORM DEVO-ID
        WHEN "MED" PERFORM MED-ID
        WHEN "STL" PERFORM STL-ID
        WHEN "EXC" PERFORM EXC-ID
        WHEN "CLAIM" PERFORM CLAIM-ID
        WHEN "PART" PERFORM PART-ID
        WHEN "E2E" PERFORM E2E-ID
        WHEN "TXID" PERFORM TXID-ID
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "99" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

DOMAIN-ID.
    MOVE "PIX-TXN" TO WS-SEQ-NAME
    CALL "BSEQ" USING WS-SEQ-NAME WS-SEQ WS-SEQ-ST
    IF WS-SEQ-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-SEQ-ST TO LS-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-SEQ TO WS-NUM
    MOVE WS-NUM TO WS-ED11
    STRING "X" DELIMITED SIZE WS-ED11 DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO LS-VALUE
    END-STRING.

